    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Z UpTime connects your WordPress site to Zubbin Central for uptime monitoring, heartbeat checks, package-aware billing status, and upgrade flows.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Upload the plugin ZIP in WordPress, activate it, then pair the site with your Zubbin Central account from the plugin settings screen.</p>\n",
        "faq": "<p>Q: Does this plugin monitor my site by itself?<br />\nA: The plugin acts as the connected node and reports to Zubbin Central, where monitoring and billing are managed.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.13</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Retry 2.0.13 after canonical slug fix</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed duplicate lower billing buttons</li>\n<li>Fixed upgrade flow to use node-linked pricing path</li>\n<li>Improved billing and release metadata handling</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
